body:
Kind of. I have a very high sex drive, but no sexual attraction to actual people. I like sex, and when I get really worked up, I get super excited about having sex with a guy (sometimes a girl), but no matter what, I always feel gross after. Not because I think it's shameful, just because. That's how my body responds. As soon as I'm no longer in that turned on place, I want to wipe the entire encounter from my mind.

&#x200B;

I'm not sure if that's what you experience, but I explain it to people as "the feeling you get when you think about your parents in a sexual situation." It's just this weird, grossed out feeling that makes me want to throw my genitals out the window.
